    "body": "This change seems a little off since it seems to suggest it's non-conforming for a document to have un-labeled contacts in a contacts list (i.e., contacts for which you know the email but not the name).\n\nIt also breaks the image following it, which now needs labels for \"astronomy@science.example.org\" and \"astrophy@cute.example\".\n",
