    "body": "> If you look at the rendering here, there's no place to put these labels. Maybe labels are a good idea, for accessibility and semantic reasons? It seems more likely to me that the content model section was not updated when options became useful outside of `<select>`.\n\nSo yeah I don’t actually know myself. It may well be that the fix we need to make here instead is actually to say that if an empty option is within a datalist, then it’s not required to have a label.\n",
